{"text":"The head of the Harvard team, recognizing in a close society the potential danger I faced, facilitated the process that enabled me to become a Mason Fellow at the Kennedy School of Government. The Edward S. Mason program provided me with the opportunity to study a diversified curriculum for a master's degree in public administration. Perhaps more importantly, in terms of preparation for leadership, the program enabled us to learn and interact with other fellows and classmates who represented current and potential leaders from all continents.","words":[{"text":"The","start":0.0,"end":1.0},{"text":"head","start":1.0,"end":1.28},{"text":"of","start":1.28,"end":1.44},{"text":"the","start":1.44,"end":1.58},{"text":"Harvard","start":1.58,"end":1.78},{"text":"team","start":1.78,"end":2.38,"punct":","},{"text":"recognizing","start":3.66,"end":4.16},{"text":"in","start":4.16,"end":4.74},{"text":"a","start":4.74,"end":4.88},{"text":"close","start":4.88,"end":5.18},{"text":"society","start":5.18,"end":5.88},{"text":"the","start":5.88,"end":6.12},{"text":"potential","start":6.12,"end":6.62},{"text":"danger","start":6.62,"end":7.2},{"text":"I","start":7.2,"end":7.5},{"text":"faced","start":7.5,"end":8.24,"punct":","},{"text":"facilitated","start":9.14,"end":9.56},{"text":"the","start":9.56,"end":10.1},{"text":"process","start":10.1,"end":10.58},{"text":"that","start":10.58,"end":11.68},{"text":"enabled","start":11.68,"end":12.16},{"text":"me","start":12.16,"end":12.64},{"text":"to","start":12.64,"end":12.82},{"text":"become","start":12.82,"end":13.18},{"text":"a","start":13.18,"end":13.46},{"text":"Mason","start":13.46,"end":13.78},{"text":"Fellow","start":13.78,"end":14.16},{"text":"at","start":14.16,"end":15.02},{"text":"the","start":15.02,"end":15.14},{"text":"Kennedy","start":15.14,"end":15.4},{"text":"School","start":15.4,"end":15.78},{"text":"of","start":15.78,"end":15.98},{"text":"Government","start":15.98,"end":16.38,"punct":"."},{"text":"The","start":23.72,"end